        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nTOPOLOGICAL n-MANIFOLD M:\n  1. Hausdorff (distinct points have disjoint neighborhoods).\n  2. Second countable (countable basis of open sets).\n  3. Locally Euclidean: every point p ∈ M has a neighborhood U\n     homeomorphic to Rⁿ (or the half-space Hⁿ = {x : xₙ ≥ 0} if p ∈ ∂M)."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#007",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The conditions 1+2 exclude pathological examples (long line, etc.)."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#008",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MANIFOLDS WITH BOUNDARY:\n  Interior points: neighborhood ≅ Rⁿ.\n  Boundary points: neighborhood ≅ Hⁿ (half-space), xₙ ≥ 0.\n  ∂M = set of boundary points. ∂M is an (n-1)-manifold (without boundary)."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXAMPLES:\n  n=0: Finite discrete set (0-manifold without boundary).\n  n=1: R, S¹, (0,1) (1-manifolds). With boundary: [0,1].\n  n=2: R², S², T², Σ_g, RP², Klein bottle, Möbius band (with boundary).\n  n=3: R³, S³, T³, S²×S¹, lens spaces, hyperbolic 3-manifolds."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "NON-EXAMPLES:\n  Figure 8 (not locally Euclidean at crossing point).\n  Cone over S¹ at the cone point (not locally Rⁿ at tip).\n  [0,1) × [0,1) at the corner (not locally R² or H² at corner)."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#011",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ORIENTABILITY:\n  An n-manifold M is orientable if it has a consistent \"orientation\" across all charts.\n  Precisely: all transition maps have positive Jacobian determinant.\n  Equivalently: the tangent bundle TM is trivial or the top cohomology Hⁿ(M;Z) = Z."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#012",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Orientable surfaces: Σ_g (genus-g closed surfaces), S², T², cylinders.\n  Non-orientable surfaces: RP², Klein bottle, Möbius band.\n```"
    },
