      "text": "### Charts and Coordinate Systems"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#016",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCHART (coordinate system): A pair (U, φ) where:\n  U ⊆ M is open.\n  φ: U → Rⁿ is a homeomorphism onto an open subset of Rⁿ.\n  φ assigns coordinates (x₁,...,xₙ) to each point of U."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#017",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TRANSITION MAP: Given two charts (U, φ) and (V, ψ) with U∩V ≠ ∅:\n  φ ∘ ψ⁻¹: ψ(U∩V) → φ(U∩V)  is a map from Rⁿ to Rⁿ."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#018",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ATLAS: A collection {(Uα, φα)} of charts covering M."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#019",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "C^∞ SMOOTH ATLAS: All transition maps φα ∘ φβ⁻¹ are C^∞ (infinitely differentiable)."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-MANIFOLDS.md#020",
      "path": [
        "09-MANIFOLDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:09-manifolds, git-history:topology:09-manifolds]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "current_path": "topology/09-MANIFOLDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:manifolds",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[manifolds]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Manifolds",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SMOOTH MANIFOLD: A topological manifold with a maximal smooth atlas.\n  \"Maximal\" = you've included every chart compatible with the smooth structure.\n  A smooth structure is determined by any smooth atlas (take its maximal extension)."
